    "chunk_text": "dweardum het \u00dea w\u00e6s him eallum gesegen, swa swa hit w\u00e6s, \u00fe\u00e6t him w\u00e6re from Drihtne sylfum heofonlic \u00dea rehton heo him & s\u00e6gdon sum halig spell & godcundre lare word: bebudon him \u00fea, gif he \u00dea he \u00f0a h\u00e6fde \u00fea wisan onfongne, \u00fea eode he ham to his huse; & cwom eft on morgenne, & \u00fey \u00d0a ongan seo abbudisse clyppan & lufigean \u00fea Godes gife in \u00fe\u00e6m men; & heo hine \u00fea monade Ond heo hine in \u00fe\u00e6t mynster onfeng mid his godum, & hine ge\u00feeodde to gesomnunge \u00feara Ond he eal, \u00fea he in gehyrnesse geleornian meahte, mid hine gemyndgade; & swa swa cl\u00e6ne & his song & his leo\u00f0 w\u00e6ron swa wynsumu to gehyranne, \u00fe\u00e6tte seolfan \u00fea his lareowas \u00e6t his Song he \u00e6rest be middangeardes gesceape & bi fruman moncynnes & eal \u00fe\u00e6t st\u00e6r enesis, \u00fe\u00e6t is Ond swelce eac o\u00f0er monig be \u00fe\u00e6m godcundan fremsumnessum & domum he geworhte. In eallum \u00fe\u00e6m he geornlice gemde, \u00fe\u00e6t he men atuge from synna lufan & mand\u00e6da, & to lufan For\u00feon he w\u00e6s se mon swi\u00fee \u00e6fest & regollecum \u00feeodscipum ea\u00f0modlice under\u00feeoded. Ond wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fea \u00f0e in o\u00f0re wisan don woldon, he w\u00e6s mid welme micelre ellenwodnisse Ond he for\u00f0on f\u00e6gre \u00e6nde his lif betynde & geendade. For\u00feon \u00fe",
